# Sidequest: Play Blitzball needs 6 or more combat damage dealt to a player this turn: noncombat damage is not counted. On turn 3
# the pumped Anaba Bodyguard (2/3 +2/+0) deals 4 combat damage to Bot2 and Shock deals 2 more before combat: 6 damage in all, but
# only 4 of it combat damage, so Blitzball stays a Sidequest enchantment with no Equipment attached, and Anaba is 4/3 from the pump alone.
# Black Lotus and Mox Jet pay for Anaba on turn 1; Blitzball and Shock are cast on turn 3 with the three Moxes and the Mountain drawn.

